WEBVTT

00:10.450 --> 00:12.700
I guess you're our first targets.

00:12.700 --> 00:14.410
Let's get this over with.

00:14.410 --> 00:17.080
What?! I'm the one who's gonna win!

00:17.080 --> 00:19.200
You've got this, team!

00:19.200 --> 00:22.410
Lucifer and Angelica... Not good.

00:22.410 --> 00:23.410
Are they strong?

00:23.410 --> 00:25.330
From what I heard, very.

00:25.330 --> 00:29.700
But they always skip class,
so I don't have further details.

00:29.700 --> 00:32.250
I'm taking you out first, Lavie!

00:35.080 --> 00:36.540
Ow...

00:38.000 --> 00:40.580
Oh-ho... Not bad.

00:42.500 --> 00:44.330
Right back at ya!

00:46.750 --> 00:48.950
Not bad at... all!

00:52.080 --> 00:53.200
Coco!

00:54.330 --> 00:55.660
One to zero!

00:57.870 --> 01:00.700
I'll take it easy on you.

01:00.700 --> 01:03.290
I won't use any magic.

01:04.260 --> 01:09.590
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

01:04.260 --> 01:09.590
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

01:09.590 --> 01:14.090
Seven colours are not enough

01:09.590 --> 01:14.090
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

01:14.090 --> 01:19.760
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

01:14.090 --> 01:17.090
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

01:17.090 --> 01:19.760
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

01:19.760 --> 01:25.760
The story is going beyond

01:19.760 --> 01:25.760
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

01:29.930 --> 01:35.260
The bell toll in my heart

01:29.930 --> 01:35.260
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

01:35.260 --> 01:39.590
is getting louder bit by bit

01:35.260 --> 01:39.590
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

01:39.590 --> 01:43.090
Believe in the excitement

01:39.590 --> 01:43.090
sono takanari wo shinjite

01:43.090 --> 01:45.590
And take one step forward

01:43.090 --> 01:45.590
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

01:45.590 --> 01:52.920
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

01:45.590 --> 01:52.920
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

01:51.260 --> 01:53.920
Can't be for sure

01:51.260 --> 01:53.920
zettai nante nai

01:52.920 --> 01:55.590
Nothing

01:52.920 --> 01:55.590
nanimo

01:53.920 --> 01:56.590
There's no guarantee

01:53.920 --> 01:56.590
kakushin wa dekinai

01:55.590 --> 01:58.260
No one

01:55.590 --> 01:58.260
daremo

01:56.590 --> 01:59.260
But I won't give up

01:56.590 --> 01:59.260
demo akiramenai

01:58.260 --> 02:00.920
That's why

01:58.260 --> 02:00.920
dakara

01:59.260 --> 02:01.420
I can still move forward

01:59.260 --> 02:01.420
susundeku koto ga

02:01.250 --> 02:02.760
I can still move forward

02:01.250 --> 02:02.760
dekiru yo

02:02.760 --> 02:08.590
Because there's magic right in here

02:02.760 --> 02:08.590
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

02:08.590 --> 02:14.920
It started to be brighter than the stars

02:08.590 --> 02:14.920
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

02:14.920 --> 02:19.590
I can't stop now

02:14.920 --> 02:19.590
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

02:19.590 --> 02:25.260
It entered into a new era

02:19.590 --> 02:25.260
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

02:25.260 --> 02:29.590
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

02:25.260 --> 02:29.590
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

02:29.590 --> 02:33.260
And go beyond the future

02:29.590 --> 02:33.260
saki no hou e

02:44.950 --> 02:47.620
You seem rather chipper today, Lavie-san.

02:47.620 --> 02:51.200
Oh? You think so? I mean, I'm not that chipper.

02:51.200 --> 02:52.660
All right, all done.

02:58.580 --> 03:00.200
Here you go, Lynette.

03:02.500 --> 03:04.540
Thank you so much!

03:04.540 --> 03:06.410
It's lovely!

03:06.410 --> 03:08.250
I'm glad you like it.

03:08.250 --> 03:10.330
Ashley...?

03:10.330 --> 03:12.500
What about mine?

03:12.500 --> 03:14.790
Oh, I'll make yours another time.

03:16.000 --> 03:18.080
Another... time?

03:22.870 --> 03:24.000
There!

03:25.450 --> 03:28.200
So if you hit someone with
the ball like that, you get a point.

03:28.200 --> 03:31.830
Yes. And the team to get 15 points first wins.

03:31.830 --> 03:34.790
Whoever gets hit will trade
with someone in the outfield.

03:33.400 --> 03:34.790
Sorry!

03:34.790 --> 03:37.040
Those are the basic rules to bumpball.

03:34.790 --> 03:37.040
It's okay.

03:37.040 --> 03:40.000
This is a league tournament divided into blocks,

03:40.000 --> 03:41.330
so there are probably five matches.

03:41.330 --> 03:43.580
And if we win our block...

03:43.580 --> 03:45.330
We'll get 60 points.

03:45.330 --> 03:47.450
We'll just have to do our best!

03:47.450 --> 03:49.250
Are you allowed to use magic?

03:49.250 --> 03:51.790
You're allowed to use one kind.

03:51.790 --> 03:54.580
One, huh? In that case...

03:54.580 --> 03:55.830
Heya!

03:56.950 --> 03:58.290
So you were watching our game.

03:58.290 --> 04:02.620
Melissa! And, uh...

04:02.620 --> 04:04.330
I'm Lily.

04:04.330 --> 04:06.000
And I'm Coco.

04:06.000 --> 04:08.290
You should know that by now, jeez.

04:08.290 --> 04:09.450
Sorry about that.

04:09.450 --> 04:12.870
You're going to be on our team
the next tournament, right?

04:12.870 --> 04:14.620
Yes. We look forward to it.

04:14.620 --> 04:17.660
And you guys have Lavie and Ashley, too!

04:17.660 --> 04:19.120
That means we're totally set!

04:20.540 --> 04:22.450
Ashley, you jerk!

04:22.450 --> 04:27.160
Why are you so mad?
I made you a bag the other day!

04:29.120 --> 04:30.830
Never mind!

04:30.830 --> 04:32.370
Lavie-san!

04:35.500 --> 04:36.910
Lavie?

04:38.290 --> 04:39.580
What happened?

04:39.580 --> 04:42.660
I can't say that I'm entirely sure myself.

04:42.660 --> 04:46.620
Ashley-san made me a tote bag, but...

04:47.660 --> 04:49.580
Ashley, you nincompoop.

04:49.580 --> 04:51.290
You dunce.

04:53.290 --> 04:54.290
Coco!

04:54.290 --> 04:56.620
One to zero!

04:56.620 --> 04:59.500
I'll take it easy on you.

04:59.500 --> 05:02.200
I won't use any magic.

05:14.120 --> 05:16.500
Is something going on with those two?

05:19.000 --> 05:20.790
Yeah! Now we're tied!

05:20.790 --> 05:23.580
You shouldn't get so cocky over one point!

05:34.620 --> 05:35.500
What's the big idea?!

05:35.500 --> 05:37.410
Well, you should pay more attention!

05:37.410 --> 05:38.450
Look out!

05:40.660 --> 05:41.790
This is all your fault, Ashley!

05:41.790 --> 05:43.410
Stop blaming other people!

05:44.790 --> 05:46.370
Damn it...

05:46.370 --> 05:47.750
Take that!

05:53.580 --> 05:55.080
Eight to one!

05:55.080 --> 05:55.930
I'm counting on you.

05:55.930 --> 05:57.120
Leave it to me!

05:57.120 --> 05:59.200
The game's just getting started!

05:59.200 --> 06:02.500
Ugh, what is Ashley even doing?

05:59.900 --> 06:01.380
At this rate...

06:03.160 --> 06:04.870
Lavie.

06:04.870 --> 06:06.500
I need you to do the thing.

06:08.620 --> 06:11.580
The thing, eh? You got it!

06:11.580 --> 06:14.120
Yeah, yeah! Rose-chan!

06:14.120 --> 06:16.750
Go, fight! Go, fight, Rose-chan!

06:16.750 --> 06:19.250
You're amazing, you're amazing, Rose-chan!

06:25.540 --> 06:26.870
Lynette, the ball, please.

06:26.870 --> 06:29.000
—Oh, right.
—That's Lavie's...

06:29.000 --> 06:30.580
Physical reinforcement magic.

06:42.000 --> 06:43.000
Two to eight!

06:43.000 --> 06:44.200
What the hell are you doing?!

06:44.200 --> 06:47.000
What the heck was I
supposed to do with that ball?!

06:47.000 --> 06:48.120
Take this!

06:49.830 --> 06:51.080
What?!

06:53.790 --> 06:54.910
There!

06:57.660 --> 06:59.000
One more!

07:06.910 --> 07:08.320
Angelica.

07:09.250 --> 07:11.290
You owe me one.

07:15.950 --> 07:16.870
Rosetta?

07:16.870 --> 07:18.660
Wait, did the spell wear off already?

07:27.540 --> 07:29.160
This is for Rose-chan!

07:29.160 --> 07:30.540
Hup. Luci!

07:30.540 --> 07:32.700
Got it! Take that!

07:32.700 --> 07:33.520
Lily-san!

07:33.520 --> 07:34.540
I'll be okay!

07:37.660 --> 07:38.750
Coco!

07:38.750 --> 07:40.700
Wait, that's not Lily?

07:40.700 --> 07:45.200
That's Lily's magic. She can switch places
with Coco in a mere instant.

07:45.200 --> 07:47.370
What even is the point in that?

07:49.790 --> 07:53.160
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry, Coco!

07:53.160 --> 07:58.580
No... I should really catch on by now...

07:58.580 --> 08:00.620
Coco!

08:00.620 --> 08:02.620
For crying out loud...

08:07.160 --> 08:10.330
Without using Echo Gift? Amazing...

08:16.450 --> 08:19.410
Coco! Thank goodness!

08:19.410 --> 08:21.160
Th-Thank you very much.

08:21.160 --> 08:23.370
You don't need to thank me.

08:24.080 --> 08:26.950
Healing an enemy's wounds? You softie.

08:26.950 --> 08:29.700
That's because you keep
injuring people, Shrimpy Luci!

08:29.700 --> 08:31.000
What'd you call me?!

08:33.450 --> 08:34.450
There!

08:36.750 --> 08:39.000
Oh, my bad. My hand slipped.

08:39.000 --> 08:41.250
You totally did that on purpose!

08:43.290 --> 08:45.330
Excuse me... Please calm down, you two.

08:45.330 --> 08:46.660
What?!

08:46.660 --> 08:48.580
We'll settle this after the match!

08:48.580 --> 08:50.290
Sounds good to me!

08:50.290 --> 08:51.290
Take that!

08:56.950 --> 08:59.370
Fifteen to three! Game set!

08:59.370 --> 09:01.080
All right, let's settle this once and for all!

09:01.080 --> 09:02.950
Bring it on! Step outside!

09:02.950 --> 09:05.450
We already are outside!

09:04.220 --> 09:05.450
Sorry...

09:06.330 --> 09:08.080
You just kept letting them hit you.

09:08.080 --> 09:09.790
What?! You were also—

09:09.790 --> 09:11.120
Hey, it's okay, you two.

09:11.120 --> 09:14.000
We still have four matches left.
We can still turn things around!

09:14.000 --> 09:16.200
Oh, Lavie.

09:16.200 --> 09:17.370
Your uniform...

09:18.700 --> 09:22.000
Oh, yeah. Eh, this is fine.

09:22.000 --> 09:24.700
Wait, but if you keep playing like that...

09:24.700 --> 09:25.910
Nothing to worry about!

09:25.910 --> 09:29.700
All right! Let's take a break
to prepare for the next match!

09:28.370 --> 09:29.700
Lavie.

09:31.120 --> 09:32.200
Take it off.

09:33.620 --> 09:34.620
Huh?

09:35.620 --> 09:38.540
Wait, does that mean that you're—

09:38.540 --> 09:42.580
Wait, no! That's not what...
Ugh, just come with me!

09:42.580 --> 09:46.290
A-Ashley, wait! That hurts!
You're hurting me, dang it!

09:56.370 --> 09:58.250
You didn't have to...

09:58.250 --> 10:00.540
I couldn't just leave you like that.

10:03.000 --> 10:04.660
Okay, all done.

10:10.540 --> 10:11.910
It's cute.

10:17.160 --> 10:19.410
Why are you so angry?

10:21.540 --> 10:23.910
It doesn't matter now. You gave me something.

10:23.910 --> 10:25.370
Gave you something?

10:26.910 --> 10:28.410
Wait—

10:29.370 --> 10:30.910
Yeah.

10:30.910 --> 10:33.660
Happy birthday!

10:33.660 --> 10:36.540
Thanks. I'll take good care of it.

10:38.540 --> 10:42.160
I'll get you a gift for
your birthday, too, Lavie.

10:42.160 --> 10:43.660
Just you wait.

10:46.160 --> 10:47.950
I'm so sorry!

10:47.950 --> 10:50.620
Don't worry about it. You gave me this.

10:50.620 --> 10:52.370
That's not enough!

10:52.370 --> 10:54.580
I know! I'll make you some clothes!

10:54.580 --> 10:55.830
Wait, clothes?

10:55.830 --> 10:57.910
Some really cute clothes!

10:57.910 --> 10:59.370
Like, super cute clothes?

10:59.370 --> 11:00.620
Yeah.

11:03.160 --> 11:06.540
Then I forgive you. Don't forget again, okay?

11:11.700 --> 11:13.700
I promise.

11:13.700 --> 11:15.200
Good.

11:26.910 --> 11:28.450
Are you okay?

11:31.120 --> 11:32.950
The other two are back.

11:33.870 --> 11:36.370
And then... Also...

11:36.370 --> 11:39.700
Looks like they made up.

11:39.700 --> 11:41.250
The game's just begun!

11:41.250 --> 11:42.500
Let's do this!

11:42.500 --> 11:43.790
Yeah!

11:44.790 --> 11:46.080
Fifteen to seven!

11:47.410 --> 11:49.410
Fifteen to five!

11:49.410 --> 11:50.200
There!

11:50.200 --> 11:51.540
Fifteen to eight!

11:54.620 --> 11:56.580
Now we're three-one.

11:56.580 --> 11:59.870
I'm better now, too. I can play.

11:59.870 --> 12:02.790
If we win the next one,
we might be able to win the whole thing.

12:02.790 --> 12:04.700
All right, let's win this thing!

12:04.700 --> 12:07.080
It'll be a piece of cake for us!

12:07.080 --> 12:10.080
Like it's going to be that easy.

12:10.080 --> 12:11.160
Ra-chan!

12:11.160 --> 12:12.950
Champe and Maryberry, too.

12:12.950 --> 12:14.540
What brings you here?

12:14.540 --> 12:18.910
We're four-zero right now!
We're gonna win it all!

12:18.910 --> 12:21.250
Easy peasy!

12:21.250 --> 12:22.700
What's peasy mean?

12:22.700 --> 12:24.080
I dunno.

12:24.080 --> 12:26.200
Ratura aside...

12:26.200 --> 12:28.410
We're definitely not losing to the other two!

12:29.500 --> 12:31.950
Well, we've got Emilia's group on our team.

12:31.950 --> 12:33.330
What?!

12:33.330 --> 12:34.660
You called?

12:35.660 --> 12:39.200
My lady, that is the team we are facing next.

12:39.200 --> 12:41.870
I see. Well, do your best.

12:43.620 --> 12:46.040
Let's have tons of fun!

12:46.040 --> 12:48.870
Regardless, we are going to win.

12:48.870 --> 12:50.160
Seriously?

12:50.160 --> 12:53.620
We've got our work cut out for us.

12:53.620 --> 12:54.790
Are they strong?

12:54.790 --> 12:58.660
Those who are not quite human...
Those three are demi-humans.

12:58.660 --> 13:03.450
Emilia, Alpha, and Salsa.
They're in the top rank, Noir.

13:03.450 --> 13:04.910
Noir...

13:04.910 --> 13:07.330
Be especially careful of Emilia.

13:07.330 --> 13:10.250
You may experience
Energy Drain if she touches you.

13:10.250 --> 13:11.870
Energy Drain?

13:11.870 --> 13:16.540
She'll drain your lifeforce.
Emilia doesn't seem to have control over it.

13:16.540 --> 13:18.000
Huh...

13:18.000 --> 13:20.950
It's amazing that you're playing
with people from Noir.

13:20.950 --> 13:22.290
Right?

13:22.290 --> 13:24.910
Though they just told us they
only needed us to make a team.

13:24.910 --> 13:27.120
We're just for show...

13:27.120 --> 13:31.540
But if you're undefeated,
then you must've beaten Lucifer's team.

13:31.540 --> 13:33.910
We didn't see those two.

13:33.910 --> 13:34.950
What?

13:34.950 --> 13:38.160
I'm sure they're just skipping again as usual.

13:40.000 --> 13:42.160
So they're still fighting...

13:45.870 --> 13:47.290
Stand by!

13:50.200 --> 13:51.870
Let's have a good game!

13:51.870 --> 13:53.660
With our height difference...

14:03.250 --> 14:05.290
Where are you throwing... Wha?!

14:07.790 --> 14:08.870
One to zero!

14:08.870 --> 14:10.870
Damn it! We're counting on you, Lyn-chan!

14:10.870 --> 14:12.620
Okay, I'll do my best.

14:15.540 --> 14:17.750
Great throw!

14:17.750 --> 14:20.830
Okay, here I go!

14:28.330 --> 14:30.620
This is, uh...

14:30.620 --> 14:33.450
I could stop that with like ten pinkies...

14:37.080 --> 14:38.540
That throw was insane!

14:38.540 --> 14:40.700
I can't believe she stopped that.

14:40.700 --> 14:43.290
Alpha-san is a magidoll.

14:44.870 --> 14:46.500
Calculations complete.

14:51.000 --> 14:52.080
Two to zero.

14:52.080 --> 14:52.790
Sorry.

14:52.790 --> 14:54.410
Leave it to me!

14:54.410 --> 14:56.040
Okay!

14:56.040 --> 14:56.630
Take that!

14:56.630 --> 14:58.000
Whoa.

14:58.000 --> 14:59.250
You still have a lot to learn.

15:04.040 --> 15:04.810
Yes!

15:04.810 --> 15:05.620
My, my.

15:10.950 --> 15:13.290
I guess grass wasn't enough to stop it.

15:13.290 --> 15:14.010
Tiara-san!

15:14.010 --> 15:15.290
Behind you! Behind you!

15:16.250 --> 15:17.250
Ow!

15:18.330 --> 15:19.910
Don't sweat it, Tia-chan!

15:21.000 --> 15:22.410
If grass won't work...

15:22.410 --> 15:24.370
Take that!

15:24.370 --> 15:27.450
O Earth, hear the resonance from the ritual!

15:27.450 --> 15:31.660
I am depicted in blood: Sorcier's Legacy.

15:31.660 --> 15:33.700
Erect a mighty wall!

15:35.330 --> 15:36.620
Four to zero!

15:38.250 --> 15:40.040
This isn't good...

15:40.040 --> 15:42.370
I have an idea.

15:42.370 --> 15:44.080
All right.

15:44.080 --> 15:46.790
Here I come, Salsa! My newest throw!

15:48.700 --> 15:50.200
Hey, a flying pig!

15:50.200 --> 15:51.910
Ooh, where? Where?!

15:51.910 --> 15:53.660
You're wide open!

15:53.660 --> 15:54.360
Yeah!

15:54.360 --> 15:55.410
Well done!

15:55.410 --> 15:57.410
No fair, Lavie!

15:57.410 --> 16:00.870
Salsa, you're at fault
for letting your guard down.

16:01.830 --> 16:04.910
Salsa-sama, let us switch.

16:04.910 --> 16:05.910
Boo...

16:05.910 --> 16:07.450
Salsa!

16:09.580 --> 16:12.330
Okay, I'm gonna get you back for that!

16:16.870 --> 16:19.000
That really is scary...

16:19.000 --> 16:20.870
In that case...

16:20.870 --> 16:23.790
Honour the name of the witch of this ritual

16:23.790 --> 16:25.580
and dance, servant!

16:38.080 --> 16:44.910
One sheep... Two sheep... Fwee sheep...

16:44.910 --> 16:47.250
Fwour...

16:47.250 --> 16:49.790
Sheep...

16:49.790 --> 16:50.790
She's asleep.

16:50.790 --> 16:53.290
Yeah, she sure is.

16:53.290 --> 16:55.370
You are only allowed to use one kind of magic.

16:55.370 --> 17:00.830
Huh? But I'm just using this one magical tome.

16:58.000 --> 17:00.830
Then just use one kind of spell
from the magical tome.

17:00.830 --> 17:04.080
I will only allow the wall you erected first.

17:04.080 --> 17:06.000
But...

17:06.000 --> 17:09.040
As a penalty, the opposing team
gets three extra points.

17:09.040 --> 17:10.870
The score is now seven to one.

17:10.870 --> 17:12.290
Leave this to me!

17:13.700 --> 17:15.160
Woo-hoo! Lucky us!

17:16.040 --> 17:17.410
Hey, Ashley.

17:20.450 --> 17:22.950
We... actually have a chance!

17:22.950 --> 17:24.290
Heck yeah, we do!

17:40.040 --> 17:41.790
Fourteen to thirteen!

17:41.790 --> 17:43.500
Yeah! We turned things around!

17:43.500 --> 17:44.910
Now we're at match point!

17:44.910 --> 17:46.410
Just one more point.

17:46.410 --> 17:49.290
Do not hold back, Alpha.

17:49.290 --> 17:51.500
As you wish, my lady.

18:00.750 --> 18:01.790
What?!

18:03.950 --> 18:06.500
That's... Freedom Hand.

18:06.500 --> 18:08.250
Wouldn't that be "hair" since it's her hair?

18:08.250 --> 18:09.450
I guess.

18:09.450 --> 18:13.410
I'd like you to refrain from giving this
a silly name. Also, you lack creativity.

18:17.290 --> 18:20.660
Is that even fair?

18:18.170 --> 18:20.660
Deuce. Fourteen to fourteen.

18:20.660 --> 18:21.570
Be careful.

18:21.570 --> 18:23.120
Yeah.

18:23.120 --> 18:25.450
This isn't good.

18:25.450 --> 18:26.790
It all comes down to this.

18:26.790 --> 18:28.620
Give it to me!

18:28.620 --> 18:30.540
You took far too long to wake up.

18:32.750 --> 18:35.870
I'll show you my full power!

18:37.750 --> 18:39.120
Let's do this, Ashley!

18:40.500 --> 18:41.540
All right.

18:50.250 --> 18:51.370
Lavie! Ashley!

18:51.370 --> 18:54.290
Stand your ground!

18:59.700 --> 19:01.200
It's over!

19:08.450 --> 19:10.080
Wow!

19:12.830 --> 19:14.330
Lynette, Wonderful!

19:14.330 --> 19:15.700
That's amazing!

19:20.080 --> 19:21.450
Leave the rest to me!

19:21.450 --> 19:22.660
We're counting on you!

19:24.160 --> 19:25.410
There!

19:25.410 --> 19:26.450
How naïve.

19:26.450 --> 19:27.620
I'm not done yet!

19:38.660 --> 19:40.660
Fifteen to fourteen!

19:40.660 --> 19:42.250
We did it! We did it, we did it!

19:42.250 --> 19:43.620
Nice throw, Tia-chan!

19:43.620 --> 19:44.700
Well done!

19:44.700 --> 19:46.450
Now we're four-one.

19:46.450 --> 19:48.540
Huh? Dodge, Tiara!

19:48.540 --> 19:50.950
Huh? Ow!

19:50.950 --> 19:53.250
Deuce. Fifteen to fifteen.

19:53.250 --> 19:57.290
Wait, why? Didn't we already win?

19:57.290 --> 19:59.000
It's a deuce.

19:59.000 --> 20:00.040
Deuce?

20:00.040 --> 20:04.660
When both teams hit match point, no one wins
until one team gets two points ahead.

20:04.660 --> 20:06.040
What?!

20:08.750 --> 20:11.950
No way!

20:17.370 --> 20:19.540
Aw, no fair...

20:19.540 --> 20:20.870
It was really close.

20:20.870 --> 20:23.450
Noirs are definitely strong.

20:23.450 --> 20:26.120
But we managed to place third.

20:26.120 --> 20:27.660
All thanks to the ace!

20:27.660 --> 20:33.080
I never got to move around
that much, so I had fun.

20:33.080 --> 20:34.950
Not to mention, we won 30 points—

20:36.950 --> 20:39.540
Great job, Tiara-san.

20:39.540 --> 20:41.660
That last throw was excellent.

20:41.660 --> 20:43.450
Everyone did really great.

20:43.450 --> 20:45.830
Let's win the whole thing next time!

20:45.830 --> 20:47.250
Yeah!

20:51.000 --> 20:52.330
We did it!

20:52.330 --> 20:56.160
We were sorta just there,
but with these points we just won...

20:56.160 --> 20:58.700
We might able to go up a rank to Rouge!

20:58.700 --> 20:59.640
Right, Mar?

20:59.640 --> 21:00.620
Huh?!

21:00.620 --> 21:03.790
Um, yes, maybe...

21:10.250 --> 21:11.660
I hope you don't mind us joining you.

21:14.000 --> 21:16.700
Why are you here? You're Noirs.

21:16.700 --> 21:20.290
It's still the Lapis rank's turn...

21:20.290 --> 21:23.450
Noirs don't need to hold back.

21:23.450 --> 21:26.370
We are not breaking any rules.

21:26.370 --> 21:28.080
Tiara, was it?

21:28.080 --> 21:29.120
Yes.

21:29.120 --> 21:31.910
You're the only one to ever get a point from me.

21:31.910 --> 21:36.700
No one has taken a point from me,
but the match was somewhat delightful.

21:36.700 --> 21:39.910
Today was a lot of fun!

21:39.910 --> 21:42.040
We had fun, too. Thanks.

21:43.580 --> 21:46.450
I guess I wouldn't mind having
another match with you someday.

21:46.450 --> 21:49.370
Yeah! And we won't lose next time!

21:52.410 --> 21:54.160
Huh?

21:54.160 --> 21:56.450
If you touch me...

21:56.450 --> 21:58.700
...my Energy Drain will...

22:02.750 --> 22:03.830
Tia!

22:03.830 --> 22:06.500
Tia! Tia!
Are you all right, Tiara-san?
Tia-chan, you alive?

22:06.500 --> 22:09.580
Wake up! Get a hold of yourself!

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
mado no soto wa yasashii tsukiakari sotto

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
Outside the window, the gentle moonlight is shining softly

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
akari keshite yume no hashi wo watarou

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
Put out the lights and cross the bridge of dreams

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
kie soude kienai hikari ga ima

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
The weakening yet everlasting light is now

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
mabuta no mukou no sekai ni hirogatta

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
Spreading out into the world behind my eyelids

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
ironna omoi ga afurete

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
Various feelings are overflowing

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
kirakira mabushiku kagayaiteru

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
sparklingly and dazzlingly shining

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
zutto

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
Forever

22:58.680 --> 23:00.780
It's shining stars

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
ashita wa donna hi ni naru kana

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
I wonder what kind of day tomorrow will be

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
kokoro ni utsushidasu keshiki wa

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
The scenery that is reflected in my heart

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
kitai namida yume no zenbu ga kasanatta

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
Expectations, tears, and dreams, all of it bottled up in my heart

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
watashi no planetarium

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
My planetarium

23:19.230 --> 23:19.980
hora

23:19.230 --> 23:25.080
Look, in that star that is shining the brightest

23:19.980 --> 23:25.080
ichiban kagayaiteiru ano hoshi ni

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
negai kakete oyasumi

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
A wish is enclosed: "Good night"
